---
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---
<footer class="footer">
  <div class="wrap footer-row">
    <p>Chimera is a game by <a href="https://nichalasbarnes.com/">Nichalas Barnes</a>. Built in Unreal Engine 5. This site is the running record of where it stands.</p>
    <p><a href={base + 'updates/'}>Updates</a> · <a href="https://github.com/colorpulse6/project-chimera">Site source on GitHub</a> · {year}</p>
  </div>
</footer>
<style>
  .footer { border-top: var(--rule); margin-top: clamp(3rem, 8vw, 7rem); padding-block: 2rem 3rem; color: var(--fg-soft); font-size: 0.92rem; }
  .footer-row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 1rem 3rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .footer p { margin: 0; max-width: 48ch; }
</style>
